### SkillBridge REST API Test Suite (IntelliJ IDEA HTTP Client)
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080

### 1. Register Student A (Alice)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fullName": "Alice Johnson",
  "email": "alice@university.edu",
  "password": "Password@123",
  "collegeName": "MIT",
  "department": "Computer Science",
  "yearOfStudy": 3,
  "bio": "Backend developer teaching Java, eager to learn Python."
}

### 2. Register Student B (Bob)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fullName": "Bob Williams",
  "email": "bob@university.edu",
  "password": "Password@123",
  "collegeName": "MIT",
  "department": "Data Science",
  "yearOfStudy": 2,
  "bio": "Data science student teaching Python, looking to learn Java."
}

### 3. Login as Alice
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "alice@university.edu",
  "password": "Password@123"
}

> {% client.global.set("aliceToken", response.body.data.accessToken); %}

### 4. Login as Bob
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "bob@university.edu",
  "password": "Password@123"
}

> {% client.global.set("bobToken", response.body.data.accessToken); %}

### 5. Login as Admin
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@skillbridge.com",
  "password": "Admin@12345"
}

> {% client.global.set("adminToken", response.body.data.accessToken); %}

### 6. Get Alice's Profile
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/students/me
Authorization: Bearer {{aliceToken}}

### 7. Update Alice's Profile
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/students/me
Authorization: Bearer {{aliceToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fullName": "Alice M. Johnson",
  "collegeName": "MIT",
  "department": "Computer Science & AI",
  "yearOfStudy": 3,
  "bio": "Spring Boot & Java mentor."
}

### 8. Alice Adds TEACH Skill (Java)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/skills
Authorization: Bearer {{aliceToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "skillName": "Java",
  "skillType": "TEACH"
}

### 9. Alice Adds LEARN Skill (Python)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/skills
Authorization: Bearer {{aliceToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "skillName": "Python",
  "skillType": "LEARN"
}

### 10. Bob Adds TEACH Skill (Python)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/skills
Authorization: Bearer {{bobToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "skillName": "Python",
  "skillType": "TEACH"
}

### 11. Bob Adds LEARN Skill (Java)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/skills
Authorization: Bearer {{bobToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "skillName": "Java",
  "skillType": "LEARN"
}

### 12. Get Mutual Matches for Alice
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/matches
Authorization: Bearer {{aliceToken}}

### 13. Search Mutual Matches with Filters
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/matches/search?skillName=Python&college=MIT
Authorization: Bearer {{aliceToken}}

### 14. Alice Sends Exchange Request to Bob (Assuming Bob's ID = 3)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/requests
Authorization: Bearer {{aliceToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "receiverId": 3,
  "message": "Hi Bob! I can teach you Java & Spring Boot in exchange for Python."
}

### 15. Bob Views Received Requests
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/requests/received
Authorization: Bearer {{bobToken}}

### 16. Bob Accepts Exchange Request (Assuming Request ID = 1)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/requests/1/accept
Authorization: Bearer {{bobToken}}

### 17. View Active Connections
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/connections
Authorization: Bearer {{aliceToken}}

### 18. View Unread Notifications
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/notifications/unread
Authorization: Bearer {{aliceToken}}

### 19. Mark All Notifications as Read
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/notifications/read-all
Authorization: Bearer {{aliceToken}}

### 20. Admin Dashboard Metrics
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/dashboard
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 21. Admin List All Students
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/students
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 22. Logout Alice
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/logout
Authorization: Bearer {{aliceToken}}
